% STDM-2011-29 fig_01a: direct W + 2 jets, qg -> W+ q g with the incoming gluon splitting, W+ -> nu lbar
layout: v2
dots: all
in: qi gi
out: nu lb qo go
qi [q] -- [fermion] a -- [fermion] b -- [fermion] qo [q]
a -- [W+] w
w -- [fermion] nu [nu]
lb [\bar\ell] -- [fermion] w
gi [g] -- [gluon] s
s -- [gluon] b
s -- [gluon] go [g]
